Responsibilities:










 · Support technical delivery through coding, development, and testing;




 · Understanding of automated processes for building, testing (integration, SIT \& UAT Support), documenting, and deploying at scale;




 · Translate user requirements into the overall architecture framework and implementation of new systems;




 · Create test code to validate the application against client requirement;




 · Understand, create and debug database related queries;




 · Ensure complete technical documentation exists for all projects and processes;




 · Maintain successful relationships with application developers;




 · Performance Optimization;




 · Develop informatica mappings, debugging using queries on source and targets;




 · Successful resolution of production issues.










 Requirements:




 · Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering or a closely related field;




 · Strong knowledge of SQL, Relational Database Management Systems like Oracle, DB2 and SQL Server;




 · Experience scripting macros in MS Excel;




 · 2\-3 years SQL is required;




 · 2\-4 years ETL (SAS) experience required;




 · Proven success in contributing to a team\-oriented environment;




 · Scala development skills;




 · Experience working with Client IT and Business Team for requirements gathering;




 · Good understanding on the parameter file concepts and how they can leveraged for good design and solutions;




 · Proven ability to work creatively and analytically in a problem\-solving environment;




 · Knowledge in Informatica server and application administration;




 · Experience with Informatica Advanced Techniques Dynamic Caching, Memory Management, Parallel Processing to increase Performance throughput;




 · Designing and implementing Informatica 10\.1 PowerCenter mappings;




 · Strong SQL and related skills. Ability to develop and implement complex procedures and packages using Oracle PL/SQL;




 · Desire to work in an information systems environment.




 · Working in Agile Teams.




 · Knowledge of Jira \& Bitbucket
